    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d413">

                <pb facs="0721" n="703" sameAs="frus:frus1951v06p1/pg703"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">460.509/9–2151: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in Indonesia
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1951-09-21T18:00:00-04:00">September 21,
                            1951—6 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>361. Fol in amplification first sentence Deptel 336 Sep 17<anchor n="1" xml:id="d413-f1"/> “NSC exception for Indo under Kem Amendment valid without further renewal until Dec
                    30”. Admin required submit Congress each quarter a review all exceptions made
                    previously. Exception granted Indo Sep 13 must
                    be reviewed sometime during next quarter ending Dec 30 and decision made whether
                    continue exception.</p>
                <p>Battle Bill in Cong conference to resolve differences in House and Senate
                        versions.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d413-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d413-f1" n="1" xml:id="d413-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d413-f2" n="2" xml:id="d413-f2-content">
                <p>The reference is to the Mutual Defense Assistance Control Act, which became law
                    on October 26, as Public Law 213. The text is printed in 65 Stat. 644.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
